    {
        "text": "Pitch black."
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfathomable depth, without a shred of sunlight. The stifling atmosphere almost feels as heavy as the roof's own weight."
    },
    {
        "text": "The roof of a tomb."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on...? Why am I back here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wei, old thing, still alive? I came to see you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_gintcrturnhle"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hoarse howl)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sullen Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sound emanates from behind the heavy door before her."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been sleeping for so long, and you're still as pissy as ever...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Drop the scary act already. Can you even do anything after lying here all this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoo...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing to be afraid of... right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
