    },
    {
        "text": "Shangshu?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which mountain is this? Why isn't there a single road sign... no, what year is it even?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Judging from the houses by the road, this looks like Shangshu before it went nomadic... why does it look like the city I saw when I first got here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "*ding*\u2014 *dong*\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "A man hangs from a steep cliff with a rope, engraving a sentence with the hammer and chisel in his hands."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wei\u2014you, up on the mountain! What'cha doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1245_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't know who I am?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tumu Tianshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1245_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was I who designed and created this city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tumu Tianshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that's pretty cool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1245_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Catastrophe's about to arrive, and everyone's already evacuated. But the disaster will destroy all the houses I built.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tumu Tianshi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't let it happen just like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tumu Tianshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fifth year of Jingyan, when I had just arrived here, and stayed for three decades... 'Record of Shangshu City'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1245_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm carving how I crafted the city onto this cliff so future generations will remember my achievements!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tumu Tianshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the Catastrophe's just around the corner. You're risking your life for this, but what if a thunderbolt cleaves the mountain into two? Wouldn't your hard work be in vain?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1245_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I couldn't care less. This is the only thing I can do. Why even bother living, if no one will know of my feats?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tumu Tianshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you even live like that...? Fine, just keep working, I'll disturb you no more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wei, where does this mountain path lead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1245_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tumu Tianshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
