    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "It's you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, I wish for you to grant me a sword.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "To save. To avenge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've told you, my swords don't come cheap. What're you offering?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "My life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Again...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I should've said no already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you hate me for giving you that rusty piece of scrap metal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What am I saying? This is just an illusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you do remember me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just thinking about that screenplay draft... I still can't help but wonder if the story would've ended differently, had I given you a proper blade then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "How can someone so remarkable and knowledgeable show compassion to a nobody like me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "A mere mortal life is honestly worthless to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, don't go that far. I still like you mortals a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look at us as if you're watching a play.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your casual acts can add a little marvel to the show and change the fates of countless people. Sometimes you'll even be in the mood to join us for a few songs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in the myriad of plays, you're the only one offstage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been alone all along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blind Young Swordsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jeez, I didn't think I'd get this kind of hallucination...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm tired. Just take the sword. It's made for proper combat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me see if the story ends differently.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
