    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_799_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, I've been anticipating this for a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been waiting for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_799_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm puzzled by something that I'd like you to clarify.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do elaborate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_799_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I went to collect references at the edge of the city today, and saw an odd fowlbeast perched by the riverbank.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never seen a fowlbeast so beautiful... I was just about to whip out my brush and paper when it flapped its wings and vanished from sight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I tried to paint it from what I could remember, but I could not do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just let it go, some things are beyond your control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_799_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That holds true for others, but I still call myself a painter for the time being... so I'll always want to capture it somehow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've painted quite a lot these past few years. I always thought one had to paint plenty of paintings and see many sights to make life worthwhile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I finally realized... that paintings are ultimately inanimate objects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_799_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The scenes I paint turn into a passing cloud a moment later. The more I paint, the more insignificant I feel my paintings become.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's only natural, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "text": "One can only dream of seeing the entire land if one won't even make it to a hundred years of age.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_799_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... I think you still don't understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, I'd like to ask for some thoughts on this undeserving work of mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Ruan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
