    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They're growing well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you plant all these?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The people here did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you said, I can't use my abilities to meddle with their growth... I'll disappear one day, but these people will still be here for a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#9$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "You've worked so hard...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a while, Shu.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How very strange. That brother of mine has been telling me he's seen you in his dreams lately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#9$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you keep thinking about me...? Are you getting nostalgic with age?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know how to make fun of me too now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people here all remember a 'Shennong' who compiled the twenty-four jieqi solar terms, taught them how to till the land, and even risked her life to cultivate a vast expanse of frozen soil into fertile fields.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#2$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "How can I bear that title on my own? We achieved it all together, so why put everything on my shoulders?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been so long, is there still a difference between you or me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I remember is someone taking me in when I was wandering about aimlessly like a child, and giving me a <i>home.</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She told me I needn't care about the differences between man and beast... that I should just live as a human.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't expect you to stay here even now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I promised you I would. To stay and guard this land, so people wouldn't have to go hungry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#5$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Shu... have you ever resented me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#5$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "A thousand years. How can you call this devotion? This is clearly incarceration...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though your consciousness is gone, you're still trapped here by your ties to this land, rather than go free.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "All because of one mistake I made...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't resent you for it... only myself. For not going north in your place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#2$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "Shu... You know I've never seen you as a <i>Xian,</i> the whole time we were together. I almost forgot that you weren't mortal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only realized when we parted ways, I had my own selfish motives, a 'human' selfishness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to beg you to stay, to continue helping the people here. All of my kin need you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I wasn't sure if you would love them, as you loved me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid I've let you down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#2$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "So we failed in the end, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You never found the seeds, and I never managed to grow crops on Originium-tainted soil.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We couldn't even protect this land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#6$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "Man can prevail over nature... but when will that happen for real?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "Shu... Do you regret it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "You knew that everything I said would come to pass, didn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I always knew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.1,
        "bend": 0.25
    },
    {
        "text": "You shouldn't have met me here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're only a shred of consciousness left in this device, and I'm a memory within.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1",
        "duration": 2,
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I <i>am</i> you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indistinct Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
