    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm always with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Free'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A command to want and rage, in greed for life and fear for death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I nearly forgot why I even created you back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "text": "No place of place amidst high mounts or waters far; no matter to me free amidst the human realm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been muddleheaded for so long that I even lost track of why I'm awake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who ever said you had to paint the entire realm to be considered an artist? Just paint a realm, and true it be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
