        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "The painter brandishes her blade, and mounts rise in succession."
    },
    {
        "text": "I am me."
    },
    {
        "text": "And what I see is all."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
