    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A director can't be sleeping on set, right? That's crazy irresponsible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong with taking a snooze when you're tired... which one are we shooting this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Mecha-Feranmut vs Feranmut.</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. Isn't that the screenplay I stashed away in the bottom of my drawer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean it's <i>that</i> bad...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "I swear, this year is the last one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anything can be spun into a good story, that's what legends and strange tales are...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "I gotta ask, li'l Lava.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "What makes you so willing to humor me for so long?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The legendary weapon you promised. When are you going to give it to me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure enough, you're still after that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you miss me, if I were to vanish one day without a trace? For good?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that day comes, no one will remember you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "The weapons, tools, cities, and those films you made will all vanish... you know that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right... I shouldn't be seeing you here either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, you called it. The dumb stuff I waste time on again and again all amounts to nothing in the end. But I can't help it. I just wanna have some fun and leave some memories behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave something behind and have fun. That's enough for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, li'l Lava. It was pretty fun making trouble with you at Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Humiliating... I ended up giving myself a lecture with something I crafted with my own hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Letting people go through these old and irrelevant memories just like that is really something...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_magic_3"
    },
