    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, enough of that. We answered that question when we managed to split off from chaos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just a heart. So stop dreaming about taking us back in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "We worked hard to be free from that pitch-black tomb. We're not about to go back to living under your shadow, old thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I'll\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
